## Tablet: 768px to 1199px

Reduce the sidebar width or use a collapsible navigation pattern.

Reduce hero typography.

Allow category grids to wrap.

Reduce card padding where necessary.

Keep all primary actions visible.

## Mobile: below 768px

Use a compact top navigation.

Replace the permanent desktop sidebar with a drawer or a suitable mobile navigation pattern.

Do not simply shrink the desktop sidebar until it becomes unusable.

Use a single-column hero layout.

Move the hero visual below the main heading or reduce its size.

