36px to 42px.

Hero description:
14px to 15px.

Primary buttons:
At least 44px high.

Cards:
Use a responsive grid.

Prevent horizontal scrolling.

Quiz answer options:
Full width.

Quiz card:
20px padding where space allows.

Results cards:
Stack vertically when necessary.

Modal:
Fit within the viewport.

Ensure touch targets are sufficiently large.

Use safe-area insets where relevant.

Test at 360px and 390px viewport widths.

## Small screens

Hide only nonessential decorative elements.

Never hide the question, answer options, score, timer, or necessary navigation.

Do not allow fixed elements to cover important content.

